F\\\") (footprint \\\"Inductor_SMD:L_0805_2012Metric_Pad1.05x1.20mm_HandSolder\\\")\"},\n        {\"source\": \"netlist\", \"quote\": \"(net (code \\\"59\\\") (name \\\"unconnected-(C6-Pad1)\\\") (class \\\"Default\\\") (node (ref \\\"C6\\\") (pin \\\"1\\\") (pintype \\\"passive\\\")))\"},\n        {\"source\": \"spice\", \"quote\": \"C6 unconnected-_C6-Pad1_ 0 0.1u\"}\n      ],\n      \"impact\": \"The capacitor provides no decoupling or filtering, and the wrong footprint risks assembly with a different part or a mis-sized pad.\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.4\n    }\n  ],\n  \"summary\": \"The netlist ties SKW92A LAN_PORT3_TX+ and LAN_PORT3_TX- (pins 13 and 14) to the GND net, which is inconsistent with the module's pinout and the intended Ethernet function. A secondary, lower-confidence issue is a 0.1 uF capacitor with an inductor footprint and a floating terminal.\"\n}",
